---
import SectionHeader from './SectionHeader.astro';
---

<section class="section problem">
  <div class="container--narrow">
    <SectionHeader>
      You have runway and a thesis.<br />
      <span class="text-accent">You don't have a product team.</span>
    </SectionHeader>

    <div class="problem__block" data-fade data-fade-delay="0.1">
      <p class="text-body-lg problem__text">
        You've raised or set aside capital, you know the problem you want to solve,
        but there's no senior product + engineering in&#8209;house.
      </p>
      <p class="text-body-lg problem__text">
        Every agency and freelancer gives you a different story about scope, timeline,
        and cost. You can't tell who's right. Meanwhile, with no product, you have
        no traction, no investor story, and no way to learn from real users.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="problem__block problem__block--secondary" data-fade data-fade-delay="0.15">
      <h3 class="problem__block-title">Agencies are slow. Freelancers disappear. AI alone ships the wrong thing.</h3>
      <p class="text-body problem__text">
        AI coding agents are powerful, but on their own they build random features,
        not a fundable product. Someone has to decide <em>what</em> to build,
        <em>why now</em>, and <em>what &ldquo;good&rdquo; looks like.</em>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div data-fade data-fade-delay="0.2">
      <p class="text-body-lg problem__closer">
        We've been founding CTOs, built and exited our own company, and shipped 15+
        products to production. Now we use our own AI&#8209;native build system to do
        the same work faster and with more control. You get founder&#8209;level judgment
        and execution speed in one package.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem__block {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .problem__block--secondary {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .problem__block-title {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .problem__block--secondary .problem__block-title {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .problem__text {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .problem__closer {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
</style>
